    function methods(){return`<article class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Current study files</h2><p>The revised handover, with the report and notebook this artifact accompanies.</p></div></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="file-list">${m.X.manifest.files.map(f=>`<a href="${esc(f.href)}" ${f.href.endsWith('.pdf')?'target="_blank" rel="noopener"':'download'}>${icon('file')}<span><strong>${esc(f.label)}</strong><small>${esc(f.description)}</small></span><span class="external-symbol">↗</span></a>`).join('')}</div></div></article><article class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Definitions and interpretation</h2><p>A local companion to a retrospective study of saved historical predictions.</p></div><button class="icon-button" data-action="source" data-source="study" aria-label="Study sources and limitations">${icon('info')}</button></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="method-columns"><div><h3>How the comparison works</h3><p>Four fixed model families receive prior sector return, prior EGX30 return and signed observed rate change. Full-history models include a legacy-index indicator. Text variants add four past-trained statement components.</p><p>The target is the first actual eligible trading session strictly after each recorded meeting. Word2Vec/PCA features are mathematical coordinates, not validated sentiment scores.</p><h3>What the measures mean</h3><dl class="definition-grid"><dt>MAE</dt><dd>Average absolute forecast miss, in pp. Lower is better.</dd><dt>RMSE</dt><dd>Root mean squared miss; larger misses receive more weight.</dd><dt>Direction</dt><dd>Correct up/down forecasts among non-flat actual returns. Zero predictions do not count as up or down.</dd><dt>Balanced direction</dt><dd>Average of up and down recall; requires both actual classes.</dd><dt>Paired difference</dt><dd>Text MAE minus numerical MAE. Negative favors text.</dd></dl></div><div><h3>Bounds on interpretation</h3><ul><li>Publication clocks and historical text vintages are unverified. Prior results were inspected.</li><li>Samples are small, dependent and overlapping. The sector-index definition changes in January 2020.</li><li>Saved 95% intervals use 2,000 circular five-announcement block replications and no multiplicity adjustment.</li><li>Observed policy changes are not measured surprises. Event timing alone does not establish causality.</li><li>Before-rate levels are implications. The November 2009 8.25% level remains conditional continuity.</li></ul><h3>People and sources</h3><p>Ahmed Yasser<br>Dr. Shaimaa Masry<br>Dr. Amira Tarek<br>Prof. Dr. Andre Guettler</p><p>CBE original statements and policy decisions; Refinitiv .EGBANK, .EGREAL and .EGX30 closes. This local package establishes no redistribution permission.</p></div></div><div class="source-downloads"><a class="quiet-button" href="data/provenance.json" download>File provenance</a><a class="quiet-button" href="vendor/dependencies.json" download>Local asset versions</a><button class="quiet-button" data-action="print">Print current workspace</button></div></div></article>`;}
